Render Blueprint: proofmint-api (backend)
APP_ENV=production
DATABASE_URL=managed by Render fromDatabase (do not fill manually)
UPLOAD_DIR=/var/data/uploads
MOMENTWEAVE_EXPORT_DIR=/var/data/momentweave_exports
MAX_VIDEO_MB=20
MAX_VIDEO_SECONDS=180
PAYPAL_BASE_URL=https://api-m.sandbox.paypal.com
FRONTEND_URL=https://REPLACE-FRONTEND.onrender.com
CORS_ORIGINS=https://REPLACE-FRONTEND.onrender.com
PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=(enter privately in Render)
PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET=(enter privately in Render)
RECEIPT_SIGNING_SECRET=(generate privately: python -c "import secrets;print(secrets.token_hex(32))")
DEMO_UPLOAD_TOKEN=(generate privately: python -c "import secrets;print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))")

Render Blueprint: proofmint-web (frontend)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://REPLACE-API.onrender.com
IMPORTANT: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is embedded at BUILD time; redeploy frontend after changes.
